WEBVTT

WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.800
¿Qué estás haciendo?

00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:02.960
Where are you taking me?

00:00:02.960 --> 00:00:07.320
Leave me. Help! Someone!

00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:09.440
Help! You animals!

00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:12.720
Enough! Drop her here!

00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:14.000
Get up!

00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:17.960
Hey. Hey.

00:00:17.960 --> 00:00:21.120
Do you mind if I have a little snack?

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:24.440
Violence always raises my appetite.

00:00:24.440 --> 00:00:25.720
Yeah.

00:00:31.320 --> 00:00:33.920
Sorry, no hugs this time.

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:35.680
I’m afraid I might get dirty.

00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:38.200
You’re afraid of getting dirty?!

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:42.640
A whole soap factory couldn’t clean

00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:45.160
you and your slut!

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:49.800
Stupid rich girl.

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:52.720
Crawling in your own spit,

00:00:52.720 --> 00:00:55.280
and yet still being so rude.

00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:02.400
What’s with all the theatrics?

00:01:02.400 --> 00:01:03.560
Bella, bravo, bravo.

00:01:03.560 --> 00:01:06.480
So brave, so fearless, right?

00:01:06.480 --> 00:01:08.160
No wonder my little brother

00:01:08.160 --> 00:01:09.680
clings to you.

00:01:09.680 --> 00:01:11.360
Even I'm curious

00:01:11.360 --> 00:01:13.360
about playing with you

00:01:13.360 --> 00:01:15.800
a little game.

00:01:15.800 --> 00:01:17.000
How do you feel about

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:18.800
family addition?

00:01:18.800 --> 00:01:20.560
I heard you recently became

00:01:20.560 --> 00:01:22.320
a pure orphan.

00:01:22.320 --> 00:01:24.560
You’re a filthy animal!

00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:29.920
Wanna hear a little story?

00:01:29.920 --> 00:01:32.240
Once upon a time,

00:01:32.240 --> 00:01:33.560
my parents

00:01:33.560 --> 00:01:36.280
offered yours a business merger.

00:01:36.280 --> 00:01:38.960
And what did the Aspens do?

00:01:38.960 --> 00:01:40.840
They brushed us off.!

00:01:40.840 --> 00:01:43.320
They told us our money “smell” to them!

00:01:43.320 --> 00:01:44.720
Fucking smell!

00:01:46.880 --> 00:01:48.080
Get out!

00:01:51.480 --> 00:01:53.680
Do you remember

00:01:53.680 --> 00:01:55.080
what eventually happened

00:01:55.080 --> 00:01:56.480
to your family?

00:01:58.440 --> 00:02:02.240
Don't repeat their mistakes.

00:02:02.240 --> 00:02:04.120
All I need is

00:02:04.120 --> 00:02:07.640
a third of everything you have.

00:02:07.640 --> 00:02:09.640
Sign over

00:02:09.640 --> 00:02:13.080
what’s your grandfather owned.

00:02:13.080 --> 00:02:16.160
Agree, sis.

00:02:16.160 --> 00:02:18.360
Don’t be stubborn.

00:02:20.440 --> 00:02:22.000
Sis?

00:02:23.760 --> 00:02:26.600
I am no sister of yours.

00:02:33.720 --> 00:02:35.600
Don’t touch me!

00:02:35.600 --> 00:02:37.400
You know what, Greg?

00:02:37.400 --> 00:02:40.520
You're even dumber than I thought.

00:02:40.520 --> 00:02:42.120
Don't you know my

00:02:42.120 --> 00:02:43.520
signature means nothing

00:02:43.520 --> 00:02:46.320
without Mason’s legal consent?

00:02:48.040 --> 00:02:49.880
You need a lawyer?

00:02:49.880 --> 00:02:51.080
No problem.

00:02:51.080 --> 00:02:52.320
Hey. Come here.

00:02:52.320 --> 00:02:54.440
This is my lawyer.

00:02:54.440 --> 00:02:58.240
And about Mason...

00:02:58.240 --> 00:02:59.480
What?

00:02:59.480 --> 00:03:00.640
What about Mason?

00:03:00.640 --> 00:03:02.720
What?

00:03:02.720 --> 00:03:05.600
How about asking him?
